sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Cu as Customer
  participant K as Kafka
  participant T as Trust
  actor A as Admin
  K--)T: OrderDelivered, store delivered_item_projection
  Cu->>T: POST /reviews (order item, rating, text)
  T->>T: delivered to this user? one review per item?
  T->>T: fake-review rules: burst, seller-linked, near-duplicate text
  alt clean
    T--)K: ReviewPublished
  else suspicious
    T--)K: ReviewFlagged
    A->>T: uphold or dismiss with reason (MFA)
  end
  T->>T: recalculate product and seller score, score_history row
  T--)K: ProductTrustScoreUpdated, SellerTrustScoreUpdated
  Note over K: Catalog, Search, Recommendation and Insights consume the score updates
